ent-Wristwatch = 手錶 | wristwatch
    .desc = 一款用來看時間的便宜手錶。你玩《太空站14》浪費了多少時間？ | A cheap watch for telling time. How much did you waste playing Space Station 14?
ent-WristwatchGold = 金錶 | gold watch
    .desc = 一只價值超過你一顆腎臟的奢華手錶。這只手錶曾屬於臭名昭著的「辛迪加」黑幫分子——綽號「200磅馬肉絞肉機」的武尼巴爾多·弗雷迪亞尼。 | A fancy watch worth more than your kidney. It was owned by the notorious Syndicate mobster Vunibaldo "200 Pound Horse Meat Grinder" Frediani.
